{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:31 2026-06-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:31 2026-06-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:31 2026-06-12 HKT</p><p>今(12日)約8時，錦田錦江路一個鐵皮回收場發生斬人血案。一名非華裔男子報案稱，自己被另一名男子以利刀斬背部，兇徒逞兇後逃去，他背部受傷淌血，仍然清醒，其後被送院救治。警方列傷人案跟進調查。</p><img alt=\"警員到回收場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b84bdefc60c499c2f73a3d34022c56b7/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為鐵皮回收場。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f562f94a0af6811ba928ea185987debc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_28.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/23af4e9413dd82f7d623658b179f8177/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_27.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cc6179c2311bdc2ffcfa5d11562d2adc/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_26.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a970bdda4181b0c9f1dbd135a3a018d0/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d8fd07a732564506c13e703c36524891/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-12_at_09_17_22.jpeg\"/><p>據了解，回收場的員工多為非華裔人士。現場未有遺下兇刀，警方正調查兇徒動機。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-12T01:51:44.916243+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":216,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}